  "sn21.11:1.2": "One of the great disciples, said to be foremost in advising monks (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/an1.231/en/sujato'>AN 1.231</a>), as shown in the next discourse. He is seen meditating at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn54.7/en/sujato'>SN 54.7</a>, and his verses are at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag10.3/en/sujato'>Thag 10.3</a>. ",
  "sn21.11:1.3": "",
  "sn21.11:1.4": "",
  "sn21.11:1.5": "As a Western monk, I feel seen. ",
